# MadGraph5 batch script: p p > b b~ inside an inclusive-HT window.
#
# The pp_to_bb row's card (shipped defaults, ebeam 6500, NNPDF23_lo_as_0130_qed
# through LHAPDF) with ihtmin = 200 and ihtmax = 500 at maxjetflavor = 4. The b
# quarks are b-class there, outside the jet sum htj and inside the inclusive
# sum iht (cuts.f:898-906), so this window is the only cut on the final state:
# a generator that dropped the b's from iht would read zero, and one that put
# them in htj would read the same value as this row and is caught by the
# per-event tests instead.
generate p p > b b~
output pp_to_bb_iht -nojpeg
launch
  set ebeam1 6500
  set ebeam2 6500
  set pdlabel lhapdf
  set lhaid 247000
  set ihtmin 200
  set ihtmax 500
  done
